WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.429
A century ago, the Jing Zhang Railway proved that China could build its own railway. Today, we ask: how can artificial intelligence truly enter urban life?

00:00:10.845 --> 00:00:18.930
The challenge is not only the model. It is finding the first real user and closing a loop that is usable, governable, and ready to procure.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:27.663
At Zhong Zhi Yuan, product readiness, data checks, and accountability are completed step by step before technology enters real settings.

00:00:29.377 --> 00:00:38.849
At Artificial Intelligence Origin, residents bring real tasks. Risk triggers an immediate human handoff. The full process enters the First-Mile Passport.

00:00:39.411 --> 00:00:47.731
Da Zhong Si carries reuse and the first order. Feedback returns to product and governance, so innovation does not stop at a showcase.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:59.002
In ninety days, baseline, first use, handoff, and reuse pass gates zero through four. Let the century-old railway become artificial intelligence's first mile into everyday life.
